  <data name="Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Relation types</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Explanation" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Every relation type is a pair of labels: the direction (“is father of”) and its inverse (“is son of”). The form of the other NPC automatically shows the inverse.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="EmptyHint" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>No relation types yet. Create the first one — “is father of” with the inverse “is son of”, for example.</value>
